225 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 76 0 R/E(How do we determine the "right" price for my home? We use a Strategic Market Analysis. I don't just look at what your neighbor\220s house sold for last year; I look at current "Active" competition, recent "Solds" \(within the last 6 months\), and current market demand in Marietta and the surrounding area to ensure we price for maximum excitement and equity.)/Pg 21 0 R/K[0]>>
endobj

226 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 76 0 R/E(Do I need to renovate my kitchen before listing? Not necessarily. I specialize in identifying "High-ROI" updates. Sometimes, a fresh coat of neutral paint and professional staging provide a better return than a full remodel. I will walk through your home with you and give you a prioritized list of what will actually put more money in your pocket.)/Pg 21 0 R/K[1]>>
endobj

227 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 76 0 R/E(How will you make my home stand out online?  Your first showing happens on a smartphone, so we make it stunning. Every listing receives high-resolution professional photography and strategic placement on Bright MLS, social media, and major search portals. We don\220t just find a buyer; we find the best buyer.)/Pg 21 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

228 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 76 0 R/E(Do I have to leave the house for every showing? Ideally, yes. Buyers feel more comfortable exploring the home and speaking freely when the owner isn't present. We will work together to create a Flexible Showing Schedule that maximizes "eyes on the property" while respecting your family's routine.)/Pg 21 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

229 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 76 0 R/E(What happens if the home inspection finds an issue? This is where my role as your Strategic Advocate is most important. I handle the "tough talk" with the buyer\220s agent. We will navigate the repair requests together, deciding what is reasonable to fix and what we can negotiate to keep the deal on track without sacrificing your equity.)/Pg 21 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

230 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 76 0 R/E(What if the house doesn't appraise for the sale price? If we have multiple offers, we often negotiate "Appraisal Gaps" upfront. If an appraisal comes in low, I use my data pack to challenge the appraisal or negotiate with the buyer to find a middle ground that protects your bottom line.)/Pg 21 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

231 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 76 0 R/E(How long will it take to sell my home? While the "Days on Market" can fluctuate, our goal is to create 'Auction-like' excitement in the first 7 days. Typically, once we accept an offer, it takes 30 to 45 days to get to the closing table.)/Pg 21 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

232 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 76 0 R/E(What are my costs as a seller? Typically, you should budget for the real estate commission, the PA/MD transfer tax \(usually split with the buyer\), and any attorney or title fees. I will provide you with a "Seller Net Sheet" before we even list, so you know exactly what you\220ll be walking away with at closing.)/Pg 21 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

233 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 76 0 R/E( FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS)/Pg 21 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

