564 0 obj
<</Title(Once your home is live on the market, the goal is to make every showing as seamless and inviting as possible.)/Dest[18 0 R/Fit]/Parent 557 0 R/Next 568 0 R>>
endobj

565 0 obj
<</Title(Buyers feel like "intruders" if the seller is present. To allow them to speak freely with their agent and truly envision themselves living in the home, it is best to leave the property at least 15 minutes before the scheduled time.)/Dest[18 0 R/Fit]/Parent 557 0 R/Prev 568 0 R>>
endobj

566 0 obj
<</Title(2. Set the Stage \(The Senses\))/Dest[18 0 R/Fit]/Parent 548 0 R/Prev 557 0 R/First 569 0 R/Last 570 0 R/Count -3/Next 558 0 R>>
endobj

567 0 obj
<</Title(Seller\220s Guide)/Dest[16 0 R/Fit]/Parent 562 0 R>>
endobj

568 0 obj
<</Title(1. The "Golden Rule": Be Absent)/Dest[18 0 R/Fit]/Parent 557 0 R/Prev 564 0 R/Next 565 0 R>>
endobj

569 0 obj
<</Title(Scent: Avoid strong air fresheners or candles, which can trigger allergies or make buyers wonder if you\220re hiding a smell. A "clean" smell or the light scent of baked goods is best.)/Dest[18 0 R/Fit]/Parent 566 0 R/Next 571 0 R>>
endobj

570 0 obj
<</Title(Temperature: Keep the home at a comfortable temperature \(neither too hot nor too cold\) to encourage buyers to stay longer.)/Dest[18 0 R/Fit]/Parent 566 0 R/Prev 571 0 R>>
endobj

571 0 obj
<</Title(Sound: Turn off the television. If you wish to have music, play soft, instrumental background music at a very low volume.)/Dest[18 0 R/Fit]/Parent 566 0 R/Prev 569 0 R/Next 570 0 R>>
endobj

